  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Digital Public Goods Alliance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the Secretariat for the Digital Public Goods Alliance in support of the DPGA Strategy, long-term strategic objectives and annual roadmaps. The Digital Public Goods Alliance is a multi-stakeholder initiative which aims to accelerate the attainment of the sustainable development goals in low- and middle-income countries by facilitating the discovery, development, use of, and investment in digital public goods.

Amongst the goals, the DPGA Strategy targets cost-effective and scalable approaches for using DPGs to enable climate action. It also targets building safe and inclusive digital public infrastructure, for enhancing collaboration between countries, and for strengthening local creation and implementation capacity in low, and middle income countries.</narrative>
  </description>
